WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.720
1. Go to Renewals. Overdue notice deadlines are at the top.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.613
2. Click Record decision on a contract.

3
00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:11.267
3. Choose Renew, Let it end or Renegotiate, and add a short note.

4
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:16.762
4. Click Save decision. The reminder emails for it stop. Renew starts a new draft linked to this contract.
